title: Fix stale bandersnatch static public keys in sp-keyring
doc:
  - audience: Runtime Dev
    description: |
      The latest draft of the bandersnatch VRF spec changed the key derivation
      method, and this made the static public key table in `sp-keyring` stale.
      This refreshes the static public keys so they match the keys derived by
      `sp-core`. Only relevant with the `bandersnatch-experimental` feature.
crates:
  - name: sp-keyring
    bump: patch
